# Mandate — environment variables
#
# Copy to .env.local for local development, or set these in the Vercel dashboard
# under Settings → Environment Variables.

# =============================================================================
# Required for the deployed app
# =============================================================================

# Address of the Mandate registry on Midnight Preprod, printed by
# `npm run contract:deploy`.
#
# This is not optional. Without a registry there is no contract to prove
# against, so the app refuses to connect and says so on the connect screen.
# Mandate has no path that authorizes a spend without a Compact proof verified
# by a deployed contract.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=

# =============================================================================
# Optional
# =============================================================================

# Base URL of a block explorer, used to link transaction ids in the activity
# log. Omit and the ids are shown as plain text.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_EXPLORER_URL=

# =============================================================================
# Deployment only — never set these in Vercel
# =============================================================================
#
# Used solely by `npm run contract:deploy`, which runs on your machine. The seed
# controls a funded wallet; keep it out of the browser bundle, out of Vercel and
# out of version control.

# Hex seed of a Preprod wallet holding tNIGHT and tDUST.
# MIDNIGHT_WALLET_SEED=

# Preprod service endpoints. Take these from the Midnight docs, or read them
# out of Lace via the connector's getConfiguration().
# MIDNIGHT_INDEXER_URI=
# MIDNIGHT_INDEXER_WS=
# MIDNIGHT_NODE_URI=

# A proof server you run locally for deployment, e.g. via the Midnight docker
# image. The browser app does NOT need this — it delegates proving to Lace.
# MIDNIGHT_PROOF_SERVER=http://127.0.0.1:6300

# Where the deploy script fetches the ZK keys from. Point at a running instance
# of this app, e.g. http://127.0.0.1:3000/zk
# MANDATE_ZK_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000/zk

# Password encrypting the deploy script's local private state. 16+ characters.
# MANDATE_STATE_PASSWORD=

# =============================================================================
# Deliberately absent
# =============================================================================
#
# There is NO network-id variable. Preprod is pinned in lib/network.ts, the
# wallet is asked for that network, and the app refuses to proceed if the wallet
# reports a different one. Pointing these unaudited circuits at mainnet is not a
# configuration option, and `lib/architecture.test.ts` fails the build if a
# network env var is reintroduced.
